OL,3,GNEWSATen NHS trusts referred over
OL,4,Amonitoring consent
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen mental health trusts have been
OL,7,Freported to the health regulator after
OL,8,Fproblems with patient consent
OL,9,Fprocedures when monitoring patients
OL,10,Fusing camera technology.
OL,12,FThe issue emerged during the latest
OL,13,Fhearings of the Lampard Inquiry, which
OL,14,Fis examining the deaths of more than
OL,15,F2,000 people who spent time in mental
OL,16,Fhealth units in Essex between 2000 and
OL,17,Fthe end of 2023.
OL,19,FThe infrared technology is used in
OL,20,Fpatients' bedrooms and can monitor
OL,21,Fbreathing and pulse without staff
OL,22,Fhaving to enter the room.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
