OL,3,GNEWSATen NHS trusts referred over
OL,4,Amonitoring consent
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS England told the inquiry it had
OL,7,Fpassed information to the Care Quality
OL,8,FCommission (CQC) after reviewing the
OL,9,Fuse of digital monitoring systems,
OL,10,Fincluding Oxevision.
